{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27322","headline":"倢伃怨 · 陈标","name":"倢伃怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掌上恩移玉帐空，香珠满眼泣春风。\n飘零怨柳凋眉翠，狼籍愁桃坠脸红。\n凤辇祗应三殿北，鸾声不向五湖中。\n笙歌处处回天睠，独自无情长信宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}